@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+## Context
+
+`createRentalService()` keeps equipment in a `Map` and bookings in an array with parsed `from`/`to`
+timestamps; `book` detects clashes with `from < b.to && b.from < to`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Add `availability(query: AvailabilityQuery): string[]` to `RentalService`, with
+  `AvailabilityQuery { start: string; end: string; kind?: EquipmentKind }`.
+- Reuse `parseMidnight` and the `end > start` check for the period; validate `kind` only when it is not
+  `undefined`. Extract the overlap predicate shared with `book` so both agree on the half-open rule.
+- Filter equipment by kind, drop items with an overlapping booking, and return ids sorted with the default
+  string sort (code unit order), deterministic and dependency-free.
+
+## Risks
+
+None significant: the query is read-only and does not change existing behavior.
