@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The desk needs to see at a glance what can still be rented for a given period, instead of trying `book`
+item by item.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service. It returns the sorted ids of the
+  equipment that is free for the whole period.
+- When `kind` is given (`'board'` or `'sail'`) only equipment of that kind is considered; otherwise all kinds.
+- The period follows the existing rules (UTC midnight, `end` after `start`, half-open); an invalid period or
+  an invalid `kind` throws.
+
+Scope: rentals of boards and sails at the booking desk (read-only query).
+Out of scope: prices in the result, reservations, cancellations, lessons, customers, persistence, season
+(April to October) enforcement.
+
+No runtime dependency is introduced.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `rentals`: adds an availability query over registered equipment.
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/index.ts` (new method on `RentalService`, plus a query type) and `test/rental.test.ts`. No existing
+behavior or dependency changes.
